  - text: From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
  - figure "S&P 500 company headquarters":
    - link:
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:S&P_500_Headquarters.svg
      - img
    - text: S&P 500 company
    - link "headquarters":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Headquarters
  - paragraph:
    - text: The
    - link "S&P 500":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S&P_500
    - text: is a
    - link "stock market index":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stock_market_index
    - text: maintained by
    - link "S&P Dow Jones Indices":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S&P_Dow_Jones_Indices
    - text: . It comprises 503
    - link "common stocks":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_stock
    - text: which are issued by 500
    - link "large-cap":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Market_capitalization
    - text: companies (including two share classes of stock from three of its component companies (
    - link "Alphabet":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alphabet_Inc.
    - text: ","
    - link "Fox Corporation":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fox_Corporation
    - text: and
    - link "News Corp":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/News_Corp
    - text: ). The index includes about 80% of the American stock market by capitalization. It is weighted by
    - link "free-float":
      - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capitalization-weighted_index#Free-float_weighting
    - text: market capitalization.
    - superscript:
      - link "[1]":
        - /url: "#cite_note-Methodology-1"
    - text: An updated weighting of each component is available
    - link "online":
      - /url: https://www.ssga.com/us/en/intermediary/etfs/state-street-spdr-sp-500-etf-trust-spy
    - text: .
