  - region "Selected changes to the list of S&P 500 components":
    - heading "Selected changes to the list of S&P 500 components" [level=2]
    - link "edit source":
      - /url: /w/index.php?title=List_of_S%26P_500_companies&action=edit&section=2
    - paragraph:
      - text: S&P Dow Jones Indices updates the components of the
      - link "S&P 500":
        - /url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S&P_500_Index
      - text: periodically, typically in response to acquisitions, or to keep the index up to date as various companies grow or shrink in value.
      - superscript:
        - link "[4]":
          - /url: "#cite_note-4"
      - text: Between January 1, 1963, and December 31, 2014, 1,186 index components were replaced by other components.
